 stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield h-6 w-6 text-gold\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium bg-emerald-400/15 text-emerald-400\">3 Preferred Partners</span></div><h2 class=\"font-[family-name:var(--font-cormorant)] text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary\">Insurance</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary\">Trusted marine insurance partners recommended by Jeff Brown Yachts. Hull coverage, P&amp;I liability, crew protection, and more.</p><div class=\"mt-4 flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium text-gold transition-colors group-hover:text-gold-hover\">View Details<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></div></a><a class=\"group rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-card p-6 transition-colors hover:border-border-light\" href=\"/portal/services/captain-crew\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex items-start justify-between\"><div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gold-muted\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users h-6 w-6 text-gold\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></div><span class=\"rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium bg-emerald-400/15 text-emerald-400\">Available Now</span></div><h2 class=\"font-[family-name:var(--font-cormorant)] text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary\">Captain &amp; Crew</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary\">Professional captain and crew services for yacht delivery, training, and charter operations in the Pacific Northwest.</p><div class=\"mt-4 flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium text-gold transition-colors group-hover:text-gold-hover\">View Details<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></div></a><a class=\"group rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-card p-6 transition-colors hover:border-border-light\" href=\"/portal/services/berth-marina\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex items-start justify-between\"><div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gold-muted\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-anchor h-6 w-6 text-gold\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 6v16\"></path><path d=\"m19 13 2-1a9 9 0 0 1-18 0l2 1\"></path><path d=\"M9 11h6\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"4\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><span class=\"rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium bg-blue-400/15 text-blue-400\">Slips Available</span></div><h2 class=\"font-[family-name:var(--font-cormorant)] text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary\">Berth &amp; Marina</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary\">Premium moorage options in the Seattle area with priority access and preferred rates at designated marina locations.</p><div class=\"mt-4 flex items-center gap-1 text-